<div class="article-detail-page">
    <div class="article-body">

        <p>The Lively Affiliate Program allows eligible creators to earn commission by sharing Lively with their audience.</p>
        <p>When someone clicks your personalized affiliate link and makes an eligible purchase within 3 days, you earn a commission.</p>

        <h2 id="who-can-apply">Who can apply?</h2>

        <p>To qualify, you must:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Be at least 18 years old</li>
            <li>Have 1,000+ followers or subscribers on a single social platform</li>
            <li>Meet the standards set by <a href="https://impact.com">impact.com</a></li>
        </ul>

        <h2 id="how-it-works">How does the affiliate program work?</h2>

        <ol>
            <li>Apply at <a href="#">livelyaffiliates.com</a>.</li>
            <li>Tell us about your audience and platforms.</li>
            <li>If approved, you'll receive access to your personalized affiliate links.</li>
            <li>Share links to Lively products, shows, searches, and more.</li>
            <li>Earn commission on eligible purchases made within 3 days of a link click.</li>
        </ol>

        <p>The program is powered by <a href="https://impact.com">impact.com</a>.</p>

        <h2 id="get-paid">How do I get paid?</h2>

        <p>All payouts are processed through Impact directly to your bank account.</p>
        <p>To set up payouts:</p>
        <ol>
            <li>Log in to your <a href="https://impact.com">impact.com</a> account.</li>
            <li>Go to <strong>Settings → Finance → Bank Account.</strong></li>
        </ol>
        <p>For more help, visit <a href="#">Impact's Help Center</a>.</p>

        <h2 id="more-questions">More questions?</h2>

        <p>Visit the <a href="#">Lively Affiliate portal</a> for details about eligibility, commission rates, and payouts, or <a href="#">contact us</a>.</p>

